or happens with the same service, so it's very possible that this is media issue.\r\n\r\nWhile pro-active reaction to HLS spec violation sounds as proper implementation, it makes ExoPlayer less steady and friendly to media already floating around (especially comparing to non-ExoPlayer based players). Any chances to ignore invalid tracks? Mark them unsupported?\r\nFrom user perspective since it's subtitles track - loosing playback for such media is bigger harm than loosing track itself.\r\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/746077288/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"stari4ek","id":327778,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNzc3OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/327778?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stari4ek","html_url":"https://github.com/stari4ek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stari4ek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stari4ek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stari4ek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stari4ek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stari4ek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stari4ek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stari4ek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stari4ek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stari4ek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":4124694378,"node_id":"MDE1OlJlZmVyZW5jZWRFdmVudDQxMjQ2OTQzNzg=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/events/4124694378","actor":{"login":"christosts","id":54315740,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MzE1NzQw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5431574